---
import ClaudeLayout from "../layouts/ClaudeLayout.astro";
---

<ClaudeLayout title="Our Story" description="Why WE3 exists - small senior teams, community-driven innovation, and a better way to build.">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="page-header reveal-up">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">The WE3 Story</p>
      <h1>Small Teams for Big Challenges</h1>
      <p class="page-header__lead">
        In a world where traditional consulting is breaking and AI is changing everything,
        we built WE3 to deliver big outcomes with small, interdisciplinary teams—while
        nurturing the next generation of builders.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Shift -->
  <section class="section reveal-up">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-header__label">The Changing Landscape</span>
        <div class="section-header__rule"></div>
      </div>

      <article class="narrative reveal-up stagger-1">
        <h2>Why WE3 Exists</h2>

        <p>
          In today's fast-changing landscape, organizations face complex problems that demand
          both strategic insight and hands-on execution. Traditional consulting models—large
          teams of junior analysts churning out reports—are being upended by new technologies
          and client expectations.
        </p>

        <p>
          Generative AI can handle much of the "grunt work" once done by entry-level staff,
          and clients now insist on <strong>senior experts</strong> leading the charge. Many
          clients no longer want to pay for layers of hierarchy; they expect top talent on
          the front lines, augmented by AI for efficiency.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
          <p>
            "This shift creates a paradox: while leaner expert-driven teams deliver higher
            quality and faster results, it raises the question of how the next generation
            of experts will be trained."
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>
          We founded WE3 to turn this disruption into an opportunity. WE3 exists to deliver
          big outcomes with small, interdisciplinary teams—while also nurturing new talent—in
          a way that traditional firms cannot.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Vision -->
  <section class="section section--alt reveal-up">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-header__label">Our Vision</span>
        <div class="section-header__rule"></div>
      </div>

      <article class="narrative reveal-up stagger-1">
        <h2>Bridging Strategy and Execution</h2>

        <p>
          Our story began with a shared observation: Too often, companies know <em>what</em>
          they need to achieve but struggle with <em>how</em> to get there. Huge consultancies
          offer advice, and startups brim with ideas, but both can falter in bridging strategy
          and execution.
        </p>

        <p>
          We envisioned WE3 as a new kind of consultancy-meets-venture-studio, purpose-built
          for an era where experienced triads (product, design, and engineering) work side by
          side to <strong>build</strong> solutions, not just recommend them.
        </p>

        <p>
          We believe that by doing what's right for the client and the problem—even if it
          means rolling up our sleeves beyond a traditional scope—we can deliver lasting impact.
        </p>

        <div class="vision-statement panel">
          <p>
            WE3 exists to bring a better way to tackle big challenges: <strong>small senior
            teams, deeply invested in outcomes, free from bureaucracy, and unafraid to bet
            on the ideas and people that can change industries.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section reveal-up">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-header__label">Our Values</span>
        <div class="section-header__rule"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="values-intro reveal-up stagger-1">
        <h2>Culture isn't what you say. It's what you do.</h2>
        <p>
          Underpinning everything at WE3—from how we treat clients, to how we mentor
          apprentices, to how we choose venture ideas—is our culture. These six values
          guide every action, decision, and interaction.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <article class="value-card reveal-up stagger-1">
          <div class="value-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Do What's Right</h3>
          <p>
            We act with integrity and put the long-term benefit over short-term gain.
            This means being honest with clients (even if it's news they don't want to hear),
            treating people fairly, and choosing ethics over easy wins.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card reveal-up stagger-2">
          <div class="value-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/>
              <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Build Together</h3>
          <p>
            Collaboration is in our DNA. The best outcomes happen when diverse minds truly
            work in unison. Ego takes a backseat to team success. Whether it's our core triad
            or partnering with a client's team, we emphasize open communication and shared ownership.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card reveal-up stagger-3">
          <div class="value-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
              <path d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Stay Curious</h3>
          <p>
            Curiosity fuels innovation. We never assume we have all the answers; instead we
            ask questions and actively seek to learn. This drives us to explore new technologies,
            industries, and ideas with an open mind.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card reveal-up stagger-4">
          <div class="value-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Choose Courage</h3>
          <p>
            Building new things invariably involves risk and fear. We encourage each other to
            be bold and brave in the face of uncertainty. We don't shy away from hard problems
            or tough conversations.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card reveal-up stagger-5">
          <div class="value-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>See With Your Heart</h3>
          <p>
            This is about empathy and passion. We consider the human aspect—the user's perspective,
            the client's real need, our colleagues' feelings. We build solutions that genuinely
            help people and relate to teammates as whole humans.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="value-card reveal-up stagger-6">
          <div class="value-card__icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Play Like It Matters</h3>
          <p>
            Work can and should be fun, especially when you're tackling meaningful challenges.
            We bring energy and joy into what we do, brainstorming freely, prototyping ambitiously,
            and celebrating the process.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Community -->
  <section class="section section--alt reveal-up">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-header__label">Community</span>
        <div class="section-header__rule"></div>
      </div>

      <article class="narrative reveal-up stagger-1">
        <h2>Beyond Consulting</h2>

        <p>
          WE3 isn't content to simply advise others—we believe in building and investing in
          new ideas ourselves. This philosophy of "betting on ourselves" is embodied in our
          venture studio approach.
        </p>

        <p>
          We're intentionally building a <strong>community of entrepreneurs, builders, and partners</strong>
          around us. We host meetups, contribute to open-source projects, mentor at hackathons—all
          ways to stay connected with fresh ideas and talent.
        </p>

        <p>
          This community isn't just for show; it's an extension of WE3. It provides a constant
          influx of entrepreneurial energy and potential opportunities. Being plugged into a
          network of creators means we often hear about problems or ideas early. Some of those
          might turn into our next project or investment.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Next Generation -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-header__label">Next Generation</span>
        <div class="section-header__rule"></div>
      </div>

      <article class="narrative">
        <h2>Investing in the Future</h2>

        <p>
          One of WE3's differentiators is our commitment to developing the next generation
          of talent through an <strong>apprenticeship model</strong>. On each project, we embed
          three apprentices—one in product management, one in design, one in engineering—to
          shadow and contribute alongside the senior triad.
        </p>

        <p>
          Why do we do this? Because we recognize the industry's mentorship gap: as firms rely
          more on senior experts and AI replaces junior routine work, fewer young professionals
          get the chance to grow. We refuse to let the ladder pull up behind us.
        </p>

        <blockquote>
          <p>
            "By pairing apprentices with veterans, WE3 gives emerging talent a pathway into
            meaningful work—and exposes us to fresh ideas."
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <p>
          It's our way of "paying it forward" and ensuring a pipeline of skilled folks who
          share our values. Our apprentice triad is a win-win-win: new talent gets a launchpad,
          our seniors amplify their impact through mentorship, and clients benefit from a
          broader team that's motivated and cost-effective.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-panel panel text-center">
        <p class="eyebrow">Ready to work with us?</p>
        <h2>Let's build something together.</h2>
        <p class="cta-panel__text">
          Whether you're a founder with an idea, a company facing a complex challenge,
          or someone looking to join our community, we'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-panel__actions">
          <a href="/claude/brief" class="btn btn--primary">Start Your Brief</a>
          <a href="/claude/contact" class="btn btn--secondary">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ClaudeLayout>

<style>
  /* Page Header */
  .page-header {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin: var(--space-sm) 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .page-header__lead {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--c-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    padding: var(--space-section) 0;
  }

  .section--alt {
    background: var(--c-surface-2);
  }

  /* Narrative */
  .narrative h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .narrative p {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .narrative p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .narrative strong {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .narrative em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .narrative blockquote {
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--c-accent);
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
  }

  .narrative blockquote p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--c-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .vision-statement {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .vision-statement p {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Values */
  .values-intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .values-intro h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .values-intro p {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--c-muted);
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .value-card {
    background: var(--c-surface);
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    transition: transform var(--transition-base);
  }

  .value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .value-card__icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    color: var(--c-accent);
  }

  .value-card__icon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .value-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .value-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--c-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* CTA Section */
  .cta-section {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .cta-panel.text-center h2 {
    margin: var(--space-xs) 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .cta-panel__text {
    color: var(--c-muted);
    max-width: 50ch;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-lg);
  }

  .cta-panel__actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
</style>
